==========
 Changelog
==========

1.2.1 (Current)
===============
:release-date: 2025-07-05
:release-by: Enhanced Fork Maintainers

**Major Compatibility Updates:**

- [compatibility] Added Python 3.13 support
- [compatibility] Added Django 5.2, 5.1, 5.0 support 
- [compatibility] Dropped Python < 3.9 support
- [dependencies] Updated all dependencies for modern compatibility
- [oauth2] Fixed OAuth2 client secret hashing issues for django-oauth-toolkit 3.0+
- [translation] Fixed deprecated ugettext_lazy usage
- [urls] Updated deprecated django.conf.urls.url patterns
- [tests] Updated mock imports from external package to unittest.mock
- [settings] Updated MIDDLEWARE_CLASSES to MIDDLEWARE
- [security] Replaced insecure password hashers (SHA1, MD5)

**CI/CD & Development:**

- [ci] Added comprehensive GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline
- [ci] Added test matrix across Python 3.9-3.13 and Django 4.2-5.2
- [ci] Added automated security scanning with Bandit and Safety
- [ci] Added code quality checks with flake8, black, isort
- [ci] Added Codecov integration with 99% test coverage
- [ci] Added Dependabot for automated dependency updates
- [docs] Complete README modernization with badges and examples
- [security] Added security policy and vulnerability reporting guidelines

**Infrastructure:**

- [config] Added pyproject.toml for modern Python project configuration
- [config] Enhanced setup.py with project URLs and Python version requirements
- [config] Updated flake8, black, and isort configurations
- [templates] Added GitHub issue/PR templates and workflows documentation

